<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" agent="TIDE-GR design" version="24.0.0">
  <diagram id="page1" name="1 - Big Picture (beginner)">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1600" dy="1000" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1600" pageHeight="1000" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />

        <mxCell id="t1" value="&lt;b&gt;TIDE-GR: a recommender that keeps up with changing tastes, knows when it is unsure, and does not forget&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=24;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="1520" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="t2" value="Read the top row left to right (making recommendations), then the bottom row right to left (learning from what happened). The loop repeats every 3 months." style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=15;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="62" width="1520" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="r1lbl" value="&lt;b&gt;MAKING RECOMMENDATIONS&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;fontSize=14;fontColor=#1a5fb4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="105" width="400" height="25" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="b1" value="&lt;b&gt;1. New data arrives&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Every 3 months we get a new &lt;i&gt;block&lt;/i&gt; of purchases: who bought what, and when.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#555&quot;&gt;Example: Amazon Toys reviews&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=13;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="140" width="200" height="160" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b2" value="&lt;b&gt;2. Build the graph&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;People and products are dots. A purchase is a line between them.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;People who buy similar things end up close together." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=13;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="300" y="140" width="200" height="160" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b3" value="&lt;b&gt;3. The model's 'brain'&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;For every person and product it stores two things:&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;where&lt;/b&gt; they are (taste, μ)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;how sure&lt;/b&gt; it is about that (λ)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#555&quot;&gt;Encoder: LightGCN&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=13;arcSize=8;strokeWidth=3;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="560" y="140" width="200" height="160" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b4" value="&lt;b&gt;4. Make a score&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;score =&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;stable taste&lt;/b&gt; (lasts)&lt;br&gt;+ &lt;b&gt;current trend&lt;/b&gt; (popularity, season)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;They are kept separate on purpose." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=13;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="820" y="140" width="200" height="160" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b5" value="&lt;b&gt;5. How sure are we?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Turn the score into an honest chance (p) that the person will buy.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Little evidence leads to a lower, more careful chance." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=13;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1080" y="140" width="200" height="160" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b6" value="&lt;b&gt;6. Recommend&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Sure:&lt;/b&gt; show the personal top-10 list.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Not sure:&lt;/b&gt; show a safe 'trending now' list and flag it as low-confidence." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=13;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1340" y="140" width="220" height="160" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="r2lbl" value="&lt;b&gt;LEARNING FROM WHAT HAPPENED&lt;/b&gt; (one block later)" style="text;html=1;align=right;fontSize=14;fontColor=#1a5fb4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1060" y="405" width="500" height="25" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="b7" value="&lt;b&gt;7. Did taste really change?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Compare what people actually bought with what we expected.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Surprised &lt;i&gt;more than our uncertainty allows&lt;/i&gt;? Then that person has truly changed (drift)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#b0e3e6;strokeColor=#0e8088;fontSize=13;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1340" y="440" width="220" height="170" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b8" value="&lt;b&gt;8. Update carefully&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Changed people:&lt;/b&gt; loosen their old position so they can move.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Everyone else:&lt;/b&gt; keep solid knowledge firm, so nothing is forgotten." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=13;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1080" y="440" width="200" height="170" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b10" value="&lt;b&gt;9. Learn the stable taste&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Prefer patterns that hold in &lt;i&gt;every&lt;/i&gt; season. If something only works at Christmas, treat it as a trend, not as taste." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=13;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="820" y="440" width="200" height="170" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b9" value="&lt;b&gt;10. Memory box&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Keep a small sample of reliable past purchases, including one block for each season.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Used to compare seasons and to stop forgetting." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=13;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="560" y="440" width="200" height="170" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="bnew" value="&lt;b&gt;New person or new product?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Start with a sensible &lt;b&gt;guess&lt;/b&gt;:&lt;br&gt;person: average of the first things they bought&lt;br&gt;product: estimated from its title and description&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Sureness starts LOW&lt;/b&gt; and grows with each purchase. No retraining needed." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=13;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="440" width="240" height="170" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bedge" value="&lt;b&gt;Is each line still trustworthy?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Each purchase line gets a reliability score π. Old or unusual lines count less." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=12;size=14;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="300" y="320" width="220" height="80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="e1" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="b1" target="b2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e2" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="b2" target="b3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e3" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="b3" target="b4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e4" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="b4" target="b5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e5" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="b5" target="b6"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e6" value="see what people&lt;br&gt;actually bought" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="b6" target="b7"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e7" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="b7" target="b8"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e8" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="b8" target="b10"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e9" value="old examples" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="b9" target="b10"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e10" value="updated brain&lt;br&gt;for next block" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=3;strokeColor=#2d7d2d;fontSize=12;fontColor=#2d7d2d;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.75;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="b10" target="b3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="920" y="380" /><mxPoint x="710" y="380" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e11" value="joins with LOW sureness" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;strokeColor=#b59f3b;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.25;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="bnew" target="b3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="160" y="415" /><mxPoint x="610" y="415" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e12" style="html=1;endArrow=none;dashed=1;strokeColor=#d79b00;" edge="1" parent="1" source="bedge" target="b2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>

        <mxCell id="lg" value="&lt;b&gt;THE 5 PROBLEMS WE SOLVE&lt;/b&gt; (the colour shows which boxes solve each one)" style="text;html=1;align=left;fontSize=14;fontColor=#1a5fb4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="640" width="800" height="25" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pA" value="&lt;b&gt;A. The world keeps changing&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Tastes, trends and products shift over time.&lt;br&gt;Solved by boxes 7 and 8" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#b0e3e6;strokeColor=#0e8088;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="670" width="290" height="80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pB" value="&lt;b&gt;B. Real taste vs. temporary hype&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Do not mistake a Christmas spike for a real preference.&lt;br&gt;Solved by boxes 4 and 9" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="345" y="670" width="290" height="80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pC" value="&lt;b&gt;C. Knowing when we are unsure&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Do not show confident but wrong recommendations.&lt;br&gt;Solved by box 5, the reliability note, and box 6" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="650" y="670" width="290" height="80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pD" value="&lt;b&gt;D. Not forgetting the past&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Learning new things must not erase still-true old knowledge.&lt;br&gt;Solved by boxes 8 and 10" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="955" y="670" width="290" height="80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pE" value="&lt;b&gt;E. New people and products&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Handle them without retraining everything.&lt;br&gt;Solved by the yellow box" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1260" y="670" width="300" height="80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="an" value="&lt;b&gt;Simple analogy: a good shopkeeper&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;She remembers each regular customer (&lt;b&gt;brain&lt;/b&gt;) and knows how well she knows them (&lt;b&gt;sureness&lt;/b&gt;). She can tell a real change of taste from a one-off purchase (&lt;b&gt;drift check&lt;/b&gt;). She does not forget loyal customers when new ones arrive (&lt;b&gt;memory&lt;/b&gt;). She makes a sensible first guess for strangers (&lt;b&gt;new people&lt;/b&gt;). When she does not know, she says 'here is what is popular' instead of guessing (&lt;b&gt;honest confidence&lt;/b&gt;)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=13;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="780" width="740" height="190" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="gl" value="&lt;b&gt;Mini glossary&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Graph:&lt;/b&gt; dots (people, products) joined by lines (purchases).&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Embedding / belief:&lt;/b&gt; a list of numbers placing each dot on a 'taste map'.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Sureness (precision λ):&lt;/b&gt; how much evidence supports that position.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Drift:&lt;/b&gt; a real, lasting change in someone's behaviour.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Calibration:&lt;/b&gt; '70% sure' really is right about 70% of the time.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Catastrophic forgetting:&lt;/b&gt; learning new data wipes out old knowledge.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Cold start:&lt;/b&gt; a new user or item with little or no history.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Block:&lt;/b&gt; 3 months of data; the model updates once per block." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=12;align=left;spacingLeft=10;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="820" y="780" width="740" height="190" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>

  <diagram id="page2" name="2 - Detailed Architecture (with math)">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1700" dy="1150" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1720" pageHeight="1150" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />

        <mxCell id="T" value="&lt;b&gt;TIDE-GR: detailed architecture (spec v1.0)&lt;/b&gt;   &lt;font style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot; color=&quot;#555&quot;&gt;M = module; equation numbers refer to TIDE-GR_spec_v1.md&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;fontSize=22;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="15" width="1640" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="LP" value="&lt;b&gt;Per-block loop (runs every quarter, k → k+1)&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;fontSize=14;fontColor=#1a5fb4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="60" width="600" height="25" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s1" value="&lt;b&gt;1 TEST&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;predict on B&lt;sub&gt;k+1&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;br&gt;before training" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="90" width="170" height="70" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s2" value="&lt;b&gt;2 DETECT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;surprise S&lt;sub&gt;u&lt;/sub&gt; → CUSUM D&lt;sub&gt;u&lt;/sub&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#b0e3e6;strokeColor=#0e8088;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="245" y="90" width="170" height="70" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s3" value="&lt;b&gt;3 PREDICT STEP&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;loosen drifted nodes" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="450" y="90" width="170" height="70" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s4" value="&lt;b&gt;4 ADMIT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;new users/items&lt;br&gt;get priors" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="655" y="90" width="170" height="70" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s5" value="&lt;b&gt;5 UPDATE&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;joint SGD on L&lt;sub&gt;k&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;br&gt;(new block + memory)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="860" y="90" width="170" height="70" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s6" value="&lt;b&gt;6 LAPLACE&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;sureness += evidence" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1065" y="90" width="170" height="70" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s7" value="&lt;b&gt;7 FIT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;calibration κ,b,ν; W; η" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1270" y="90" width="170" height="70" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s8" value="&lt;b&gt;8 MEMORY&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;select / evict&lt;br&gt;+ curvature hand-back" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1475" y="90" width="190" height="70" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="se1" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="s1" target="s2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="se2" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="s2" target="s3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="se3" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="s3" target="s4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="se4" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="s4" target="s5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="se5" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="s5" target="s6"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="se6" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="s6" target="s7"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="se7" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="s7" target="s8"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="se8" value="next block" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="s8" target="s1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1570" y="75" /><mxPoint x="125" y="75" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell>

        <mxCell id="M0" value="&lt;b&gt;M0 · Stream and environments&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Blocks B&lt;sub&gt;k&lt;/sub&gt; (quarterly); environment e = block&lt;br&gt;Graph G&lt;sub&gt;≤k&lt;/sub&gt;; edge age Δ&lt;sub&gt;ui&lt;/sub&gt;, repeats c&lt;sub&gt;ui&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;br&gt;x&lt;sub&gt;i&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;sup&gt;e&lt;/sup&gt; = [log count, trend, log age, season]   (Eq.1)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;align=left;spacingLeft=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="220" width="360" height="110" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="M2" value="&lt;b&gt;M2 · Edge reliability (structural uncertainty)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;prior ρ(Δ) = ρ&lt;sub&gt;∞&lt;/sub&gt; + (ρ&lt;sub&gt;0&lt;/sub&gt;−ρ&lt;sub&gt;∞&lt;/sub&gt;)·e&lt;sup&gt;−Δ/τρ&lt;/sup&gt;   (Eq.3)&lt;br&gt;posterior π&lt;sub&gt;ui&lt;/sub&gt; = σ(g&lt;sub&gt;ω&lt;/sub&gt;(f&lt;sub&gt;ui&lt;/sub&gt;))   (Eq.4)&lt;br&gt;f = [age, degrees, repeats, category share, rating]&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;no model-agreement feature, so no bias loop&lt;/i&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=12;align=left;spacingLeft=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="360" width="360" height="130" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="M8" value="&lt;b&gt;M8 · Open world (new nodes)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;new user: μ&lt;sup&gt;0&lt;/sup&gt; = ζ·mean of m&lt;sub&gt;i&lt;/sub&gt; over first items   (Eq.30)&lt;br&gt;new item: μ&lt;sup&gt;0&lt;/sup&gt; = W·t&lt;sub&gt;i&lt;/sub&gt;  (text → taste map)   (Eq.31)&lt;br&gt;W = precision-weighted ridge   (Eq.32)&lt;br&gt;precision starts at λ&lt;sub&gt;0&lt;/sub&gt; (low) + local MAP refinement" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=12;align=left;spacingLeft=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="520" width="360" height="130" as="geometry" /></mxCell>

        <mxCell id="M3" value="&lt;b&gt;M3 · Node belief (the shared 'brain')&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;θ&lt;sub&gt;v&lt;/sub&gt; ~ N( μ&lt;sub&gt;v&lt;/sub&gt; , diag(λ&lt;sub&gt;v&lt;/sub&gt;)&lt;sup&gt;−1&lt;/sup&gt; )   (Eq.2)&lt;br&gt;μ = taste position · λ = sureness&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;one state, 4 jobs:&lt;/b&gt; uncertainty · memory · plasticity · cold-start prior" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=12;align=left;spacingLeft=8;strokeWidth=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="440" y="220" width="380" height="110" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="M1" value="&lt;b&gt;M1 · Encoder: reliability-weighted LightGCN&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ẑ = P(π)·Θ,  P = Σ&lt;sub&gt;l=0..L&lt;/sub&gt; Â(π)&lt;sup&gt;l&lt;/sup&gt; / (L+1)   (Eq.6)&lt;br&gt;mean pass: m = P(π)μ&lt;br&gt;variance pass: s = P&lt;sup&gt;∘2&lt;/sup&gt;(π)·λ&lt;sup&gt;−1&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;br&gt;sampled passes: ẑ&lt;sup&gt;(s)&lt;/sup&gt; = P(r&lt;sup&gt;(s)&lt;/sup&gt;)μ, r ~ Bern(π)   (Eq.7)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=12;align=left;spacingLeft=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="440" y="360" width="380" height="130" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="M1b" value="&lt;b&gt;M1b · Environment (trend) head&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;s&lt;sub&gt;env&lt;/sub&gt; = α&lt;sub&gt;u&lt;/sub&gt; · h&lt;sub&gt;ψ&lt;/sub&gt;(x&lt;sub&gt;i&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;sup&gt;e&lt;/sup&gt;),  α&lt;sub&gt;u&lt;/sub&gt; = softplus(a&lt;sub&gt;u&lt;/sub&gt;)   (Eq.8)&lt;br&gt;forecast: x̂&lt;sup&gt;k+1&lt;/sup&gt; = x&lt;sup&gt;k&lt;/sup&gt; + η(x&lt;sup&gt;k&lt;/sup&gt; − x&lt;sup&gt;k−1&lt;/sup&gt;)   (Eq.9)&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;absorbs popularity, season and recency&lt;/i&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=12;align=left;spacingLeft=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="440" y="520" width="380" height="130" as="geometry" /></mxCell>

        <mxCell id="M4" value="&lt;b&gt;M4 · Predictive distribution (how sure?)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;m&lt;sub&gt;ui&lt;/sub&gt; = m&lt;sub&gt;u&lt;/sub&gt;·m&lt;sub&gt;i&lt;/sub&gt; + s&lt;sub&gt;env&lt;/sub&gt;   (Eq.20)&lt;br&gt;v&lt;sub&gt;node&lt;/sub&gt; = Σ&lt;sub&gt;c&lt;/sub&gt;( m&lt;sub&gt;u&lt;/sub&gt;²s&lt;sub&gt;i&lt;/sub&gt; + m&lt;sub&gt;i&lt;/sub&gt;²s&lt;sub&gt;u&lt;/sub&gt; + s&lt;sub&gt;u&lt;/sub&gt;s&lt;sub&gt;i&lt;/sub&gt; )   (Eq.18)&lt;br&gt;v&lt;sub&gt;edge&lt;/sub&gt; = Var over sampled graphs   (Eq.19)&lt;br&gt;v = v&lt;sub&gt;node&lt;/sub&gt; + v&lt;sub&gt;edge&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;br&gt;p = σ( (κm + b) / √(1 + πνκ²v/8) )   (Eq.23)&lt;br&gt;split: aleatoric vs epistemic (node / edge)   (Eq.24)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=12;align=left;spacingLeft=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="860" y="220" width="400" height="170" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="M7" value="&lt;b&gt;M7 · Reliable serving&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;rank = m − β&lt;sub&gt;r&lt;/sub&gt;·√v   (Eq.33)&lt;br&gt;confidence c&lt;sub&gt;u&lt;/sub&gt; = mean p over top-K&lt;br&gt;c&lt;sub&gt;u&lt;/sub&gt; ≥ τ → personal list; otherwise trend list, flagged   (Eq.34)&lt;br&gt;weekly ACI: τ ← τ + γ(err&lt;sub&gt;t−d&lt;/sub&gt; − α)   (Eq.35)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=12;align=left;spacingLeft=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="860" y="420" width="400" height="130" as="geometry" /></mxCell>

        <mxCell id="M5" value="&lt;b&gt;M5 · Drift detector (evidence vs change)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;S&lt;sub&gt;u&lt;/sub&gt; = Σ(ℓ&lt;sub&gt;j&lt;/sub&gt; − H(p&lt;sub&gt;j&lt;/sub&gt;)) / √(Σ Var&lt;sub&gt;0&lt;/sub&gt;[ℓ&lt;sub&gt;j&lt;/sub&gt;] + ε)   (Eq.27)&lt;br&gt;C&lt;sub&gt;u&lt;/sub&gt; ← max(0, C&lt;sub&gt;u&lt;/sub&gt; + S&lt;sub&gt;u&lt;/sub&gt; − δ),  D&lt;sub&gt;u&lt;/sub&gt; = C&lt;sub&gt;u&lt;/sub&gt;   (Eq.28)&lt;br&gt;global alarm: JS(pop&lt;sub&gt;k&lt;/sub&gt;‖pop&lt;sub&gt;k+1&lt;/sub&gt;) or CUSUM on mean S   (Eq.29)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#b0e3e6;strokeColor=#0e8088;fontSize=12;align=left;spacingLeft=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1300" y="220" width="380" height="130" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="MF" value="&lt;b&gt;Drift-gated forgetting (predict step)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;λ&lt;sub&gt;v&lt;/sub&gt; ← ( 1/λ&lt;sub&gt;v&lt;/sub&gt; + q&lt;sub&gt;v&lt;/sub&gt; )&lt;sup&gt;−1&lt;/sup&gt;   (Eq.14)&lt;br&gt;q&lt;sub&gt;v&lt;/sub&gt; = ( q&lt;sub&gt;0&lt;/sub&gt; + q&lt;sub&gt;1&lt;/sub&gt;·tanh(D&lt;sub&gt;v&lt;/sub&gt;/h) ) / λ&lt;sub&gt;0&lt;/sub&gt;   (Eq.15)&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;only changed nodes become free to move&lt;/i&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=12;align=left;spacingLeft=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1300" y="380" width="380" height="110" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="M6" value="&lt;b&gt;M6 · Replay memory&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;per-environment slices + 4 seasonal slots&lt;br&gt;keep priority ϱ = π&lt;sub&gt;ui&lt;/sub&gt;·e&lt;sup&gt;−D&lt;sub&gt;u&lt;/sub&gt;/h&lt;/sup&gt;·e&lt;sup&gt;−D&lt;sub&gt;i&lt;/sub&gt;/h&lt;/sup&gt;   (Eq.36)&lt;br&gt;evicted edges hand their curvature back to λ&lt;br&gt;(each datum counted exactly once)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=12;align=left;spacingLeft=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1300" y="520" width="380" height="130" as="geometry" /></mxCell>

        <mxCell id="OBJ" value="&lt;b&gt;Training objective per block (Eq.11), optimised jointly with Adam&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;L&lt;sub&gt;k&lt;/sub&gt; =  Σ&lt;sub&gt;e&lt;/sub&gt; Σ&lt;sub&gt;(u,i)∈D&lt;sub&gt;e&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/sub&gt; −log σ(s&lt;sub&gt;ui&lt;/sub&gt; − s&lt;sub&gt;uj&lt;/sub&gt;)   &lt;font color=&quot;#2d7d2d&quot;&gt;[BPR on new block + memory]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;      + λ&lt;sub&gt;inv&lt;/sub&gt;·N&lt;sub&gt;k&lt;/sub&gt;·Var&lt;sub&gt;e&lt;/sub&gt;[ R&lt;sub&gt;e&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;sup&gt;c&lt;/sup&gt; ]   &lt;font color=&quot;#2d7d2d&quot;&gt;[stable taste: same users, every season (V-REx)]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;      + β&lt;sub&gt;KL&lt;/sub&gt;·Σ KL( Bern(π) ‖ Bern(ρ(Δ)) )   &lt;font color=&quot;#d79b00&quot;&gt;[edge reliability]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;      + ½ Σ&lt;sub&gt;v&lt;/sub&gt; ‖θ&lt;sub&gt;v&lt;/sub&gt; − μ&lt;sub&gt;v&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;sup&gt;pred&lt;/sup&gt;‖²&lt;sub&gt;λ&lt;sup&gt;pred&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/sub&gt;   &lt;font color=&quot;#9673a6&quot;&gt;[do not forget: sureness-weighted anchor]&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=13;align=left;spacingLeft=12;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="440" y="690" width="820" height="160" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="LAP" value="&lt;b&gt;Laplace update (after training)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;G&lt;sub&gt;u&lt;/sub&gt; += σ'(x)(ẑ&lt;sub&gt;i&lt;/sub&gt;−ẑ&lt;sub&gt;j&lt;/sub&gt;)²,  G&lt;sub&gt;i&lt;/sub&gt;,G&lt;sub&gt;j&lt;/sub&gt; += σ'(x)ẑ&lt;sub&gt;u&lt;/sub&gt;²   (Eq.16)&lt;br&gt;λ&lt;sub&gt;v&lt;/sub&gt; ← λ&lt;sub&gt;v&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;sup&gt;pred&lt;/sup&gt; + γ&lt;sub&gt;F&lt;/sub&gt; Σ&lt;sub&gt;w&lt;/sub&gt; P&lt;sub&gt;wv&lt;/sub&gt;² G&lt;sub&gt;w&lt;/sub&gt;   (Eq.17)&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;more evidence → more sureness&lt;/i&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=12;align=left;spacingLeft=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1300" y="690" width="380" height="160" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="DATA" value="&lt;b&gt;Datasets&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Primary: Amazon Reviews 2023, Toys&lt;br&gt;Secondary: Yelp&lt;br&gt;Pilot: Amazon Video_Games&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Protocol:&lt;/b&gt; test-then-train per block; full ranking; no random splits" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;align=left;spacingLeft=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="690" width="360" height="160" as="geometry" /></mxCell>

        <mxCell id="a1" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="M0" target="M2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="a2" value="x&lt;sup&gt;e&lt;/sup&gt;" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.75;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="M0" target="M1b"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="420" y="303" /><mxPoint x="420" y="585" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="a3" value="π" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="M2" target="M1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="a4" value="μ, λ" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="M3" target="M1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="a5" value="prior μ⁰, λ₀" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;strokeColor=#b59f3b;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.25;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.75;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="M8" target="M3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="410" y="553" /><mxPoint x="410" y="303" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="a6" value="m, s, ẑ" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.6;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="M1" target="M4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="a7" value="s&lt;sub&gt;env&lt;/sub&gt;" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.3;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.9;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="M1b" target="M4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="840" y="559" /><mxPoint x="840" y="373" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="a8" value="m, v, p" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="M4" target="M7"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="a9" value="p on new block" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.3;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="M4" target="M5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="a10" value="D&lt;sub&gt;v&lt;/sub&gt;" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="M5" target="MF"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="a11" value="λ&lt;sup&gt;pred&lt;/sup&gt;" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#9673a6;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="MF" target="M3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1290" y="370" /><mxPoint x="1290" y="200" /><mxPoint x="630" y="200" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="a12" value="D&lt;sub&gt;v&lt;/sub&gt; → priority" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.8;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.3;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="M5" target="M6"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1700" y="324" /><mxPoint x="1700" y="559" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="a13" value="past environments" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#9673a6;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0.25;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.25;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="M6" target="OBJ"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1395" y="670" /><mxPoint x="1280" y="670" /><mxPoint x="1280" y="730" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="a14" value="new μ" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="OBJ" target="LAP"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="a15" value="new λ (next block)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=3;strokeColor=#2d7d2d;fontColor=#2d7d2d;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.15;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="LAP" target="M3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1490" y="880" /><mxPoint x="425" y="880" /><mxPoint x="425" y="345" /><mxPoint x="497" y="345" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="a16" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="DATA" target="M8"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>

        <mxCell id="LEG" value="&lt;b&gt;Colour key:&lt;/b&gt;   &lt;font color=&quot;#6c8ebf&quot;&gt;■&lt;/font&gt; data   &lt;font color=&quot;#82b366&quot;&gt;■&lt;/font&gt; model / stable taste (B)   &lt;font color=&quot;#d79b00&quot;&gt;■&lt;/font&gt; uncertainty (C)   &lt;font color=&quot;#0e8088&quot;&gt;■&lt;/font&gt; shift detection (A)   &lt;font color=&quot;#9673a6&quot;&gt;■&lt;/font&gt; no forgetting (D)   &lt;font color=&quot;#d6b656&quot;&gt;■&lt;/font&gt; new users/items (E)   &lt;font color=&quot;#b85450&quot;&gt;■&lt;/font&gt; output&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Key idea:&lt;/b&gt; M3 (thick border) is one shared state. Its sureness λ is the uncertainty (M4), the anti-forgetting weight (objective), the thing loosened by drift (predict step), and the starting point for new nodes (M8)." style="text;html=1;align=left;fontSize=13;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="900" width="1640" height="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
